  "answer": "This has been reported before. PowerToys#47694 asks for the Power Display flyout to open next to its systray icon instead of a hardcoded bottom-right position. The maintainers replied that bottom-right is by design, so it is being treated as a feature request and not a bug. There is no fix yet. PowerToys#23857 reported the same thing for the Quick Access tray flyout. It was closed in 2023 as a duplicate, with a fix planned in a hotfix. If the Quick Access flyout still opens at bottom-right with a moved or vertical taskbar, that is a regression or remaining gap. Add your use case, including the vertical taskbar scenario, to PowerToys#47694 and upvote it. For now, the flyouts will keep opening at the bottom-right of the screen."
 },
